# Karbon

Karbon is a Kotlin SDK for the [Carbone.io](https://carbone.io/) document generation API.

It is meant as a modern, idiomatic and complete replacement for the official
[carbone-sdk-java](https://github.com/carboneio/carbone-sdk-java).

> Karbon is in early development. The API is not stable yet.

## Why Karbon?

- Idiomatic Kotlin API, coroutine-friendly.
- Full coverage of the Carbone API (templates, rendering, status).
- Published on Maven Central under `com.ekino.oss:karbon`, MIT licensed.

Head over to the [Quickstart](quickstart.qd) to get started.
